  <worksheets>
    <worksheet name='Q10'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Q10.  A retail manager wants answers to the following: 
Which category generates the highest profit? </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Which region performs poorly? </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>How does sales change over time? </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>a) Mention which charts you would use </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>b) Identify one key insight that management could derive </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>c) Explain how this helps in business decision-making</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources />
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style />
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Automatic' />
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows />
        <cols />
        <annotations>
          <annotation class='area' id='0' text-pinx='0.5' text-piny='0.5' text-width-delta='-18'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>a) Charts to Use&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Highest Profit by Category</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'> → </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Bar Chart</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'> (Category on Rows, SUM(Profit) on Columns).</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Poorly Performing Region</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'> → </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Bar Chart or Map</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'> (Region on Rows or Map view, SUM(Profit) or SUM(Sales) on Columns/Color).</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Sales Change Over Time</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'> → </run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Line Chart</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'> (Order Date on Columns, SUM(Sales) on Rows).</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <top-left>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
                <x-coord cell-offset='0'>
                  <node-reference />
                </x-coord>
                <y-coord cell-offset='0'>
                  <node-reference />
                </y-coord>
                <page-reference />
              </visual-coordinate>
            </top-left>
            <bottom-right>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
                <x-coord cell-offset='0.998638'>
                  <node-reference />
                </x-coord>
                <y-coord cell-offset='0.26281'>
                  <node-reference />
                </y-coord>
                <page-reference />
              </visual-coordinate>
            </bottom-right>
            <text x='0.5' y='0.5' />
          </annotation>
          <annotation class='area' id='1' text-pinx='0.5' text-piny='0.5' text-width-delta='-18'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>b) One Key Insight for Management
</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Example: </run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18' italic='true'>Technology generates the highest profit, while the South region performs poorly. Sales show seasonal spikes in November–December but decline mid‑year.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <top-left>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
                <x-coord cell-offset='0'>
                  <node-reference />
                </x-coord>
                <y-coord cell-offset='0.252893'>
                  <node-reference />
                </y-coord>
                <page-reference />
              </visual-coordinate>
            </top-left>
            <bottom-right>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
                <x-coord cell-offset='0.998638'>
                  <node-reference />
                </x-coord>
                <y-coord cell-offset='0.558678'>
                  <node-reference />
                </y-coord>
                <page-reference />
              </visual-coordinate>
            </bottom-right>
            <text x='0.5' y='0.5' />
          </annotation>
          <annotation class='area' id='2' text-pinx='0.5' text-piny='0.5' text-width-delta='-18'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>c) How This Helps in Business Decision‑Making
</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Profit Focus</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'> → Managers can prioritize investment in high‑profit categories.</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Regional Strategy</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'> → Poorly performing regions can be targeted with promotions, better distribution, or cost control.</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Sales Trend Awareness</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'> → Seasonal sales patterns help plan inventory, staffing, and marketing campaigns.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <top-left>
              <visual-coordinate class='axis'>
                <x-coord cell-offset='0'>
